~ start
~ PirateNPC

if SkeletonPirate.got_hat
	Skeleton: Thank you for finding my hat!
	Skeleton: It's been a long time since I've seen another living soul step foot on these sands.
	StoryWeaver introduced themselves to this mysterious new friend and asked if they knew anything about the island.
	Skeleton: I can't remember much before this place.
	Skeleton: All I know is that parrot flies into the jungle and only comes back to nap on my shoulder.
	Skeleton: Maybe there's something worth looking for in there?
	do SkeletonPirate.remove_exit_blocker()
else
	Skeleton: Still no luck?

=> END
